formatting to the receiver which if its a just about anything but a unix
intermediary then it will ignore your request for landscape etc etc and even
if it is may still get it wrong. So your need to discover the concepts of a
bounce queue setup. One queue to format the job streams and drop it into the
other queue to deliver the preformatted data to the printer via lpd.

    Cheers
        Mark :)



