> question is what type specification I should be looking for - just a plain
> "RZ26" or something more specific? (I'm asking since my RZ24 is marked
> "RZ24-E".)

If you do need an RZ26 then I believe that any variant would
probably do. I certainly ran my VAXstation 3100-76
on a Fujitsu 1GB SCSI drive for a while. The only
likely issue would be physical size - and in a 
MicroVAX 3100 enclosure that is not really
a problem. The only case I recall coming
across where it does matter is the
VAXstation 4000 VLC.

Antonio



