Having Service Enabled was the key. I did this:
$MCR NCP SET CIRC EWA-0 STATE OFF
$MCR NCP SET CIRC EWA-0 SERVICE ENABLED
$MCR NCP DEF CIRC EWA-0 SERVICE ENABLED
$MCR NCP SET CIRC EWA-0 STATE ON
and the load completed successfully.
Thanks very much to all who replied.

